{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Icon</strong> is a story-rich third-person RPG that plunges you into the decaying remnants of the Arx Imperium\u2014a fallen spell-punk civilization whose bones now groan under the weight of an encroaching darkness. In the ruined world of Atrum, where ancient glyphs powered by Breath\u2014the arcane lifeblood of the old world\u2014flicker dimly and an enemy lost to history once again rears their head, only one hope remains: an Icon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your chosen Icon, you will reclaim power long thought lost, unravel forgotten mysteries and rekindle the light of the Choir\u2014divine intelligences bound in silence for generations. Journey across malignant ruins, haunted catacombs, and luminous dreamscapes. With your Choral companion SET at your side, you'll light the torches of a world grown cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Turn Based Combat with a twist of real time interaction and reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Build your party from unique characters with distinct styles and narrative arcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Swap your front lines to adapt to evolving threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Explore the shattered remnants of the Arx Imperium\u2014where mysteries, ruined machines, and ancient artifacts lie beneath the dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Every location is rich with lore, danger, and dark wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fate only you can make\u2026</strong><br>Rise against the darkness and become the Legacy incarnate. A final chance. A burst of light in the marrow of a rotting world. Take up the burden of becoming... the Icon.</p>